        "text_Urc8Hy": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Freeze dried chicken dog treats are one of the healthiest, simplest, and most loved snacks you can give your pup. Made from 100% human-grade chicken breast, these treats are high in lean protein, easy to digest, and perfect for dogs of all sizes. Unlike processed biscuits with fillers or preservatives, freeze dried chicken is pure, natural, and absolutely irresistible to dogs.</p><p>At Snarky Pets, we keep things simple: just one ingredient your pup will love. Whether you’re training, topping meals, or rewarding good behavior, freeze dried chicken treats are a guilt-free way to keep tails wagging.<br/><br/></p>"
