        "text_faVBT6": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>When it comes to dog treats, less is more. Our freeze dried chicken treats contain only one ingredient: premium chicken breast. No fillers, no additives, no preservatives — just the nutrition your dog needs and the flavor they crave.<br/>Dogs thrive on high-protein diets, and chicken breast is one of the leanest, healthiest sources of protein available. It supports muscle strength, energy, and overall vitality. Plus, because these treats are single-ingredient, they’re gentle on sensitive stomachs and ideal for dogs with food allergies.<br/></p>"
          }
        }
